---
layout: base.njk
title: "Archive of Paintings"
permalink: /archives/
categories:
  - name: landscapes
    src: "/images/Landscape.jpg"
    alt: "Landscape painting of Nisqually reserve in WA"
    desc: "Landscapes"
  - name: other
    src: "/images/Sheep.jpg"
    alt: "Oil painting of a sheep in profile"
    desc: "Animals"
  - name: dogs
    src: "/images/Dog.jpg"
    alt: "Oil painting of a dog in profile"
    desc: "Dogs"
  - name: horses
    src: "/images/Horse.jpg" 
    alt: "Oil paintingof a horse grazing"
    desc: "Horses"
  - name: people
    src: "/images/Person.jpg"
    alt: "Studio oil painting of a model"
    desc: "Portraits"
---

<div class="col-12">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-2">{{ title }}</h2>
        <p>These are some samples of paintings that I've created over the years, grouped by category.
        You will also find many of these images in my blog, but here they are presented without much blurb so that you can scroll
        through them quickly.</p>
        <p>Like the rest of the site, this section is still a work in progress and I will be making it tider and easier to navigate in time.</p>
</div>
<div class = "row card-deck row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 text-center">
    {% for category in categories %}
        <div class="col mb-4">
            <div class="card imageBox h-100 p-1">
                <a class="stretched-link" href="{{ category.name }}/">
                    <img class="img img-fluid m-auto" style="height:10rem;" src="{{ category.src }}" alt='{{ category.alt }}' />
                </a>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h4 class="card-title mt-3">
                        {{ category.desc }}
                    </h4>
                </div>
            </div>      
        </div>       
    {% endfor %}
</div> 
